{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08292","headline":"赠崔秋浦三首 一 · 李白","name":"赠崔秋浦三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾爱崔秋浦，宛然陶令风。\n门前五杨柳，井上二梧桐。\n山鸟下厅事，檐花落酒中。\n怀君未忍去，惆怅意无穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08292.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08292","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}